### Testes da financas-api (IntelliJ: clique no ▶ ao lado de cada requisição)
### Rode o 1 (ou o 2) primeiro: o token fica salvo e é usado em todas as outras.

### 1. Registrar (já devolve o token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/registrar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Hemerson", "email": "hemerson@financas.com", "senha": "senha-forte-123" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 2. Login (use quando o usuário já existir)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "hemerson@financas.com", "senha": "senha-forte-123" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 2b. Login com Google (cole um ID token do Google; veja o passo a passo no chat)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{ "idToken": "COLE_AQUI_O_ID_TOKEN" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 3. Quem sou eu
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/eu
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Sem token (deve dar 401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categorias

### 5. Login com senha errada (deve dar 401)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "hemerson@financas.com", "senha": "errada" }

### 6. Criar categorias
POST http://localhost:8080/api/categorias
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Mercado" }

> {% client.global.set("catMercado", response.body.id); %}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/categorias
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nome": "Casa" }

> {% client.global.set("catCasa", response.body.id); %}

### 7. Listar categorias
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categorias
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Criar conta recorrente (luz)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "descricao": "Conta de luz", "valor": 180.50, "vencimento": "2026-11-15", "recorrente": true, "categoriaId": {{catCasa}} }

> {% client.global.set("contaLuz", response.body.id); %}

### 9. Contas que vencem nos próximos 7 dias
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contas/proximas?dias=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Pagar a conta (cria a de dezembro automaticamente)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/contas/{{contaLuz}}/pagar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Listar todas as contas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Lançar gastos
POST http://localhost:8080/api/gastos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "descricao": "Compra do mês", "valor": 450.90, "data": "2026-11-10", "categoriaId": {{catMercado}} }

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/gastos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "descricao": "Padaria", "valor": 25.00, "data": "2026-11-12" }

### 13. Gastos do mês
GET http://localhost:8080/api/gastos?mes=2026-11
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. Resumo do mês
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resumo?mes=2026-11
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. Validação (deve dar 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/gastos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "descricao": "", "valor": -5 }

### ===== Conector do Claude (OAuth) =====

### 16. /mcp sem token: deve dar 401 com "resource_metadata" no cabeçalho WWW-Authenticate
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 17. Metadados do recurso protegido
GET http://localhost:8080/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource

### 18. Metadados do servidor de autorização (deve ter registration_endpoint)
GET http://localhost:8080/.well-known/oauth-authorization-server

### 19. Registro de cliente (como o Claude faz)
POST http://localhost:8080/oauth2/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "client_name": "Claude", "redirect_uris": ["https://claude.ai/api/mcp/auth_callback"] }
